    /// <remarks>
    /// <para>Every render, not only the first. The table is behind
    /// <c>@if (view == BackupsView.Working)</c> and a filter chip rebuilds it, so a
    /// first-render-only call attaches to a table that is often not on the page yet
    /// and never runs again when it arrives. <c>attach</c> is written to be safe to
